              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "icu: Stack buffer overflow in the SRBRoot::addTag function"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A stack buffer overflow was found in Internationl components for unicode (ICU ). While running the genrb binary, the 'subtag' struct overflowed at the SRBRoot::addTag function. This issue may lead to memory corruption and local arbitrary code execution."
